mapping "X9800.1" source="X9800" target="269733003" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source X9800 SNOMED CT 269733003 = a Swedish ICD-10-SE national extension that subdivides X98
        (Athena ICD10 concept 45756466) by Swedish place/activity axes with no separate standard SNOMED CT
        analogue. Target SNOMED CT 432536 = (sctid 269733003), the verified Athena crosswalk target for X98
        (ICD10 relationship 45756466 -> 432536). Why this target: it is the authoritative standard
        concept the parent X98 maps to, and the SE subdivision is fully contained by it.
        mapping_type=broader (target subsumes the source). Confidence (high): verified crosswalk with a
        small, well-understood breadth mismatch. Athena-local research only.
        """
}
